      "seed": 4003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4004, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "addSource(handle, handler, onError)\n\nWatch a native handle for readability.\nWhen data arrives → handler() on loop thread.\nWhen peer disconnects → onError() + auto-remove.\n\nm_sources: map<NativeHandle, {handler, onError}>",
      "originalText": "addSource(handle, handler, onError)\n\nWatch a native handle for readability.\nWhen data arrives → handler() on loop thread.\nWhen peer disconnects → onError() + auto-remove.\n\nm_sources: map<NativeHandle, {handler, onError}>",
      "autoResize": true, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "sources_box", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

