    {
      "id": "t_post", "type": "text", "x": 65, "y": 478, "width": 390, "height": 55,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a5a", "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 6004, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "executeOnRunLoop(fn)\n\nPost callable from ANY thread → runs on loop thread.\nThread-safe. Wakes the loop via pipe/event.\nm_postQueue: vector<function<void()>>  (swap-drained)",
      "originalText": "executeOnRunLoop(fn)\n\nPost callable from ANY thread → runs on loop thread.\nThread-safe. Wakes the loop via pipe/event.\nm_postQueue: vector<function<void()>>  (swap-drained)",
      "autoResize": true, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "post_box", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

