      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "Linux — backend_epoll.cpp\n\nepoll_create1() + epoll_wait()\nSources: epoll_ctl(EPOLLIN)\nTimers: timerfd_create() + epoll\nWakeup: pipe2() fd pair\nError: EPOLLHUP | EPOLLERR → onError\nUnlimited sources",
      "originalText": "Linux — backend_epoll.cpp\n\nepoll_create1() + epoll_wait()\nSources: epoll_ctl(EPOLLIN)\nTimers: timerfd_create() + epoll\nWakeup: pipe2() fd pair\nError: EPOLLHUP | EPOLLERR → onError\nUnlimited sources",
      "autoResize": true, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left",
